# Two devices without a driver interrupt: each line is reported once and
# masked. The printer port's -ACK (IRQ7, a real one, not spurious) where
# the emulator has a port that interrupts; the RTC, re-armed again and
# again afterwards, stays quiet. The keyboard still works.
define: TEST_PROBES
program: keys
keys: a
---
rx286, test build
@bochs rx286: unhandled IRQ 7, now masked
rx286: unhandled IRQ 8, now masked
probe: the RTC kept interrupting; IRQ8 stayed masked
key 1E 61
